<?xml version="1.0" encoding="UTF-8"?>
<gpx version="1.1" creator="Good Shit" xmlns="http://www.topografix.com/GPX/1/1"><trk><name>Dronningstien: Røte–Lofthus — Røte–Lofthus full Dronningstien</name><desc>From upper Røte/Vassmyrane parking in Hardanger, climb the farm road to Heng, then follow blue D marks across high ground past Ulvsjaft and Duk. Join the red T-marked path at Rjukande, descend past Nosi and the historic Monk Steps, and continue through orchards to Lofthus.

